@startuml adversarial_framework_enhanced
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

component [**Red Agent**\n$\pi^{(r)}$ (fixed policy)\nMITRE ATT&CK\nConsistent Attacks] as RedAgent #FFE6E6
component [**Environment**\nState $S_t \in \mathcal{S}$\nAttack Surface\nNetwork Updates] as Environment #E6FFE6
component [**Blue Agent**\n$\pi_\theta$ (PPO policy)\nAdaptive Policy\nStrategic Decoys] as BlueAgent #E6F3FF

RedAgent --> Environment : Attack Actions $a_t^{(r)}$
Environment --> BlueAgent : Observations $O_t \in \mathcal{O}$
BlueAgent --> Environment : Defense Actions $a_t^{(b)}$
Environment --> RedAgent : State Changes $\Delta S_t$
BlueAgent --> Environment : Reward $R_t^{(b)}$

note right of BlueAgent : PPO Learning\n$\nabla_\theta J(\theta) = \mathbb{E}[\nabla_\theta \log \pi_\theta(a_t|s_t)\hat{A}_t]$
note left of RedAgent : Fixed Adversary\n$\pi^{(r)}(a_t|s_t)$ deterministic

@enduml
